#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Vigil at the Ashen Veil", -1)
$Author: Claude (sample mission for the Diaspora port)
$Created: 11/01/26 at 23:00:00
$Modified: 11/01/26 at 23:00:00
$Notes:
Sample mission generated by tools/make_vigil.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~15 min | Difficulty: Medium]] Eleven hours after the first strikes the refugee ship Pilgrim Mercy, 212 civilians from Gemenon Heights, fell out of FTL inside the Ashen Veil with a cracked drive. Hold the nebula while the Raptor Gleaner 1 takes the survivors off and the Mercy's engineers coax the drive back to life.", -1)
$end_multi_text

